OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOutbreaks of occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy rain expected, as Storm Austen
OL,7,Fmoves east. Some drier intervals are
OL,8,Falso likely. Strongest winds likely
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon, with gales
OL,10,Flikely, as rain clears east.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FChilly
OL,13,Fstart Saturday, but turning wet and
OL,14,Fwindy with rain spreading east. Windy
OL,15,FSunday, but largely dry with sunny
OL,16,Fintervals, Furtherrain and stronger
OL,17,Fwinds follow early Monday
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
